             <div class=\"contact-item\">\n                        <div class=\"contact-item-icon\">\n                            <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\" />\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\" />\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"contact-item-text\">\n                            <h4>Endereço</h4>\n                            <p>Av. Maria de Jesus Condeixa, 600 - Sala 634<br>Jardim Palma Travassos, Ribeirão Preto - SP<br>CEP: 14091-240</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"contact-item\">\n                        <div class=\"contact-item-icon\">\n                            <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z\" />\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"contact-item-text\">\n                            <h4>Telefone / WhatsApp</h4>\n                            <p>(16) 99117-7970</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"contact-item\">\n                        <div class=\"contact-item-icon\">\n                            <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                            </svg>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"contact-item-text\">\n                            <h4>Horário de Atendimento</h4>\n                            <p>Segunda a Sexta: 9h às 18h<br>Sábado: 9h às 13h</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"contact-form-wrapper\">\n                <h3>Envie uma mensagem</h3>\n                <p>Preencha o formulário abaixo e entraremos em contato o mais breve possível.</p>\n                <form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contactForm\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"name\">Nome completo</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-input\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Seu nome\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"email\">E-mail</label>\n                        <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-input\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required placeholder=\"seu@email.com\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"phone\">Telefone</label>\n                        <input type=\"tel\" class=\"form-input\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" required placeholder=\"(00) 00000-0000\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"service\">Tratamento de interesse</label>\n                        <select class=\"form-select\" id=\"service\" name=\"service\">\n                            <option value=\"\">Selecione uma opção</option>\n                            <option value=\"harmonizacao\">Harmonização Facial</option>\n                            <option value=\"toxina\">Botox</option>\n                            <option value=\"preenchedores\">Preenchedores Faciais</option>\n                            <option value=\"bioestimuladores\">Bioestimuladores</option>\n                            <option value=\"labial\">Preenchimento Labial</option>\n                            <option value=\"rinomodelacao\">Rinomodelação</option>\n                            <option value=\"outro\">Outro</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"message\">Mensagem</label>\n                        <textarea class=\"form-textarea\" id=\"message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"Conte-nos sobre suas expectativas...\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"form-submit\">\n                        Enviar Mensagem\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 19l9 2-9-18-9 18 9-2zm0 0v-8\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-content\">\n                <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n                    <h3>Dra. Caroline Cruz</h3>\n                    <p>Harmonização Facial, Preenchimento Labial, Botox e Rinomodelação em Ribeirão Preto. Transforme sua beleza natural com tratamentos personalizados e resultados naturais.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"footer-links\">\n                    <h4>Links Rápidos</h4>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"#home\">Início</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#servicos\">Serviços</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#depoimentos\">Depoimentos</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#diferenciais\">Diferenciais</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"#contato\">Contato</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"footer-contact\">\n                    <h4>Contato</h4>\n                    <div class=\"footer-contact-item\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\" />\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\" />\n                        </svg>\n                        <span>Ribeirão Preto - SP</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"footer-contact-item\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z\" />\n                        </svg>\n                        <span>(16) 99117-7970</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n                <p>&copy; 2024 Dra. Caroline Cruz. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        // ========================================\n        // NAVIGATION\n        // ========================================\n        const nav = document.getElementById('nav');\n        const mobileToggle = document.getElementById('mobileToggle');\n        const navMenu = document.getElementById('navMenu');\n        let lastScroll = 0;\n\n        // Auto-hide navigation on scroll\n        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {\n            const currentScroll = window.pageYOffset;\n            if (currentScroll > 100) {\n                if (currentScroll > lastScroll) {\n                    nav.classList.add('hidden');\n                } else {\n                    nav.classList.remove('hidden');\n                }\n            }\n            lastScroll = currentScroll;\n        });\n\n        // Mobile menu toggle\n        mobileToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {\n            navMenu.classList.toggle('active');\n        });\n\n        // Close mobile menu on link click\n        document.querySelectorAll('.nav-link').forEach(link => {\n            link.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                navMenu.classList.remove('active');\n            });\n        });\n\n        // ========================================\n        // SMOOTH SCROLL\n        // ========================================\n        document.querySelectorAll('a[href^=\"#\"]').forEach(anchor => {\n            anchor.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                const target = document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href'));\n                if (target) {\n                    const navHeight = nav.offsetHeight;\n                    const targetPosition = target.offsetTop - navHeight;\n                    window.scrollTo({\n                        top: targetPosition,\n                        behavior: 'smooth'\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // ========================================\n        // INTERSECTION OBSERVER (WOW ANIMATIONS)\n        // ========================================\n        const observerOptions = {\n            root: null,\n            rootMargin: '0px',\n            threshold: 0.1\n        };\n\n        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n            entries.forEach(entry => {\n                if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                    const delay = entry.target.dataset.delay || 0;\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        entry.target.classList.add('visible');\n                    }, delay);\n                    observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n                }\n            });\n        }, observerOptions);\n\n        document.querySelectorAll('.wow-fade-up, .wow-fade-in').forEach(el => {\n            observer.observe(el);\n        });\n\n        // ========================================\n        // PARALLAX EFFECT ON QUARTZES\n        // ========================================\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n            const quartzes = document.querySelectorAll('.quartz[data-parallax]');\n            const x = (e.clientX - window.innerWidth / 2) / window.innerWidth;\n            const y = (e.clientY - window.innerHeight / 2) / window.innerHeight;\n\n            quartzes.forEach(quartz => {\n                const parallax = parseFloat(quartz.dataset.parallax);\n                const moveX = x * 50 * parallax;\n                const moveY = y * 50 * parallax;\n                quartz.style.transform = `translate(${moveX}px, ${moveY}px)`;\n            });\n        });\n\n        // ========================================\n        // FORM SUBMISSION (WHATSAPP INTEGRATION)\n        // ========================================\n        const contactForm = document.getElementById('contactForm');\n        contactForm.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n            e.preventDefault();\n\n            const name = document.getElementById('name').value;\n            const email = document.getElementById('email').value;\n            const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value;\n            const service = document.getElementById('service').value;\n            const message = document.getElementById('message').value;\n\n            const serviceLabels = {\n                'harmonizacao': 'Harmonização Facial',\n                'toxina': 'Botox',\n                'preenchedores': 'Preenchedores Faciais',\n                'bioestimuladores': 'Bioestimuladores',\n                'labial': 'Preenchimento Labial',\n                'rinomodelacao': 'Rinomodelação',\n                'outro': 'Outro'\n            };\n\n            const serviceLabel = service ? serviceLabels[service] : 'Não informado';\n\n            const whatsappMessage = `*Nova mensagem do site*\\n\\n*Nome:* ${name}\\n*E-mail:* ${email}\\n*Telefone:* ${phone}\\n*Serviço de interesse:* ${serviceLabel}\\n*Mensagem:* ${message}`;\n\n            const whatsappNumber = '5516991177970';\n            const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/${whatsappNumber}?text=${encodeURIComponent(whatsappMessage)}`;\n\n            window.open(whatsappUrl, '_blank');\n        });\n\n        // ========================================\n        // REDUCED MOTION CHECK\n        // ========================================\n        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');\n\n        if (prefersReducedMotion.matches) {\n            document.querySelectorAll('.quartz').forEach(quartz => {\n                quartz.style.animation = 'none';\n            });\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6898a9ce-93aa-4b42-ba35-cf3221d0ea46","uuid":"4eef03e7-101e-41db-ac93-ef6db6a845cc"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_b81693629f914fc7a131a0b0","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/dra-caroline-cruz-estetica-avancada-harmonizacao-facial-pree/index.html"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6898a9ce-93aa-4b42-ba35-cf3221d0ea46","uuid":"3fa52d13-860c-4f74-a3d0-e7485a16033a","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/site-demo/dra-caroline-cruz-estetica-avancada-harmonizacao-facial-pree/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Dra. Caroline Cruz | Harmonização Facial e Estética Avançada em Ribeirão Preto</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dra. Caroline Cruz - Especialista em harmonização facial, preenchimento labial, botox e rinomodelação em Ribeirão Preto. Transforme sua beleza natural com tratamentos personalizados. Agende: (16) 99117-7970\">\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400;1,500&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        /* ========================================\n           CSS VARIABLES & ROOT STYLES\n        ======================================== */\n        :root {\n            /* Colors - Opulent Rose & Quartz Palette */\n            --color-rose: #C8758A;\n            --color-rose-light: #D99AA8;\n            --color-rose-dark: #A85D6E;\n            --color-rose-pale: #F5D5DC;\n            --color-rose-mist: #FDF0F3;\n            --color-quartz: #E8D5E0;\n            --color-quartz-warm: #F0E3EB;\n            --color-gold: #C9A86C;\n            --color-gold-light: #D9BE9A;\n            --color-charcoal: #2A2A2A;\n            --color-charcoal-light: #4A4A4A;\n            --color-taupe: #8B8680;\n            --color-taupe-light: #A8A4A0;\n\n            /* Gradients */\n            --gradient-rose: linear-gradient(135deg, #C8758A 0%, #D99AA8 100%);\n            --gradient-rose-soft: linear-gradient(135deg, #F5D5DC 0%, #FDF0F3 100%);\n            --gradient-quartz: linear-gradient(135deg, #E8D5E0 0%, #F0E3EB 100%);\n            --gradient-gold: linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A86C 0%, #D9BE9A 100%);\n            --gradient-fade: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(253,240,243,0) 0%, rgba(253,240,243,1) 100%);\n\n            /* Typography */\n            --font-display: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;\n            --font-body: 'Outfit', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n\n            /* Spacing */\n            --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n            --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n            --spacing-md: 2rem;\n            --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n            --spacing-xl: 6rem;\n            --spacing-xxl: 8rem;\n\n            /* Border Radius */\n            --radius-sm: 8px;\n            --radius-md: 16px;\n            --radius-lg: 24px;\n            --radius-pill: 100px;\n            --radius-quartz: 75% 25% / 35% 65% 65% 35%;\n            --radius-quartz-2: 55% 45% / 65% 35% 45% 55%;\n            --radius-quartz-3: 40% 60% / 55% 45% 35% 65%;\n\n            /* Shadows */\n            --shadow-soft: 0 8px 32px rgba(200, 117, 138, 0.15);\n            --shadow-glow: 0 8px 48px rgba(201, 168, 108, 0.2);\n            --shadow-elegant: 0 16px 64px rgba(42, 42, 42, 0.08);\n            --shadow-floating: 0 20px 60px rgba(200, 117, 138, 0.18);\n\n            /* Transitions */\n            --transition-fast: 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            --transition-base: 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n            --transition-slow: 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           RESET & BASE STYLES\n        ======================================== */\n        *, *::before, *::after {\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n\n        html {\n            scroll-behavior: smooth;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            background: var(--color-rose-mist);\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            line-height: 1.7;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: inherit;\n            transition: var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        ul {\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           TYPOGRAPHY\n        ======================================== */\n        h1, h2, h3, h4 {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-weight: 500;\n            line-height: 1.2;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);\n            letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n            letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n        }\n\n        h3 {\n            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n        }\n\n        .text-rose { color: var(--color-rose); }\n        .text-gold { color: var(--color-gold); }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           NAVIGATION\n        ======================================== */\n        .nav {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            background: rgba(253, 240, 243, 0.95);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            z-index: 1000;\n            transition: transform var(--transition-base);\n            box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(200, 117, 138, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .nav.hidden {\n            transform: translateY(-100%);\n        }\n\n        .nav-container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-logo {\n            font-family: var(--font-display);\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .nav-menu {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 2rem;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link {\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .nav-link::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 0;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-rose);\n            transition: width var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-link:hover::after {\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta {\n            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;\n            background: var(--color-rose);\n            color: white;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .nav-cta:hover {\n            background: var(--color-rose-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .mobile-toggle {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 5px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            padding: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .mobile-toggle span {\n            width: 25px;\n            height: 2px;\n            background: var(--color-charcoal);\n            transition: var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           HERO SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .hero {\n            position: relative;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            background: var(--gradient-quartz);\n        }\n\n        .hero-quartzes {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .quartz {\n            position: absolute;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-quartz);\n            filter: blur(60px);\n            opacity: 0.5;\n            animation: quartz-float 20s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .quartz-1 {\n            width: 500px;\n            height: 500px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose);\n            top: -10%;\n            right: -5%;\n            animation-delay: 0s;\n        }\n\n        .quartz-2 {\n            width: 400px;\n            height: 400px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose-soft);\n            bottom: -5%;\n            left: -10%;\n            animation-delay: -5s;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-quartz-2);\n        }\n\n        .quartz-3 {\n            width: 350px;\n            height: 350px;\n            background: var(--gradient-gold);\n            top: 40%;\n            left: 30%;\n            animation-delay: -10s;\n            opacity: 0.35;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-quartz-3);\n        }\n\n        .quartz-4 {\n            width: 300px;\n            height: 300px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F5D5DC 0%, #FDF0F3 100%);\n            bottom: 20%;\n            right: 20%;\n            animation-delay: -15s;\n            opacity: 0.25;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-quartz);\n        }\n\n        @keyframes quartz-float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1) rotate(0deg);\n            }\n            25% {\n                transform: translate(30px, -30px) scale(1.05) rotate(5deg);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translate(-20px, 20px) scale(0.95) rotate(-5deg);\n            }\n            75% {\n                transform: translate(-30px, -20px) scale(1.02) rotate(3deg);\n            }\n        }\n\n        .hero-container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 4rem;\n            align-items: center;\n        }\n\n        .hero-content {\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n            background: rgba(200, 117, 138, 0.15);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-rose);\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.2s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-badge svg {\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.4s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-title span {\n            color: var(--color-rose);\n        }\n\n        .hero-description {\n            font-size: 1.15rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n            max-width: 500px;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.6s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-ctas {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 1rem;\n            flex-wrap: wrap;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.8s both;\n        }\n\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            border: none;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary {\n            background: var(--color-rose);\n            color: white;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .btn-primary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-rose-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary {\n            background: transparent;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-taupe);\n        }\n\n        .btn-secondary:hover {\n            background: var(--color-rose);\n            color: white;\n            border-color: var(--color-rose);\n            transform: translateY(-3px);\n        }\n\n        .btn svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image {\n            position: relative;\n            animation: fade-up 1s ease-out 0.4s both;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .hero-image-wrapper::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose);\n            opacity: 0.15;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .hero-image img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n            display: block;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card {\n            position: absolute;\n            background: white;\n            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 1rem;\n            z-index: 10;\n            animation: card-float 6s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card.card-1 {\n            top: 10%;\n            left: -20px;\n        }\n\n        .hero-floating-card.card-2 {\n            bottom: 15%;\n            right: -20px;\n            animation-delay: -3s;\n        }\n\n        .card-icon {\n            width: 40px;\n            height: 40px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .card-icon svg {\n            width: 20px;\n            height: 20px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .card-text {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .card-text span {\n            display: block;\n            font-size: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-weight: 400;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes card-float {\n            0%, 100% {\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n            50% {\n                transform: translateY(-15px);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @keyframes fade-up {\n            from {\n                opacity: 0;\n                transform: translateY(30px);\n            }\n            to {\n                opacity: 1;\n                transform: translateY(0);\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           SECTIONS\n        ======================================== */\n        .section {\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl) 2rem;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-lg);\n        }\n\n        .section-subtitle {\n            display: inline-block;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--color-rose);\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-title {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .section-description {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal-light);\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           PROBLEM/SOLUTION SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .problem-solution {\n            background: var(--color-rose-mist);\n        }\n\n        .problem-solution-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .ps-card {\n            background: white;\n            padding: 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .ps-card::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 4px;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose);\n            transform: scaleY(0);\n            transition: transform var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card:hover::before {\n            transform: scaleY(1);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .ps-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose-soft);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .ps-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            color: var(--color-rose);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .ps-card.problem .ps-icon {\n            background: rgba(139, 134, 128, 0.15);\n        }\n\n        .ps-card.problem .ps-icon svg {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           SERVICES SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .services {\n            background: var(--gradient-quartz);\n        }\n\n        .services-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .service-card {\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);\n        }\n\n        .service-image {\n            height: 200px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .service-image img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            transition: transform var(--transition-slow);\n        }\n\n        .service-card:hover .service-image img {\n            transform: scale(1.05);\n        }\n\n        .service-content {\n            padding: 2rem;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .service-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            margin-top: -50px;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .service-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .service-card h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .service-card p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .service-link {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-rose);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            transition: gap var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .service-link:hover {\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n        }\n\n        .service-link svg {\n            width: 16px;\n            height: 16px;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           TESTIMONIALS SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .testimonials {\n            background: var(--color-rose);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .testimonials::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            background: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.05'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n        }\n\n        .testimonials .section-subtitle {\n            color: var(--color-rose-pale);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials .section-title {\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .testimonials .section-description {\n            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n        }\n\n        .testimonials-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            padding: 2rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 0.25rem;\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-stars svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n            color: var(--color-gold);\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-text {\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-style: italic;\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-author {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-avatar {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose);\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            color: white;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info h4 {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .testimonial-info span {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           DIFFERENTIALS SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .differentials {\n            background: var(--color-rose-mist);\n        }\n\n        .differentials-grid {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n            gap: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .differential-item {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n            padding: 1.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            transition: all var(--transition-base);\n        }\n\n        .differential-item:hover {\n            background: white;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .diff-icon {\n            width: 60px;\n            height: 60px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        .diff-icon::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -4px;\n            left: -4px;\n            right: -4px;\n            bottom: -4px;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-rose-pale);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            animation: pulse-ring 2s ease-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse-ring {\n            0% {\n                transform: scale(1);\n                opacity: 1;\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: scale(1.15);\n                opacity: 0;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .diff-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            color: white;\n        }\n\n        .diff-content h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        .diff-content p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           CONTACT SECTION\n        ======================================== */\n        .contact {\n            background: var(--gradient-quartz);\n        }\n\n        .contact-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            gap: 4rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-info h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .contact-info > p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-details {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            gap: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 1rem;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-icon {\n            width: 50px;\n            height: 50px;\n            background: var(--gradient-rose-soft);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-icon svg {\n            width: 24px;\n            height: 24px;\n            color: var(--color-rose);\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-text h4 {\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-item-text p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .contact-form-wrapper {\n            background: white;\n            padding: 2.5rem;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-elegant);\n        }\n\n        .contact-form-wrapper h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n        }\n\n        .contact-form-wrapper > p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n            margin-bottom: 2rem;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-label {\n            display: block;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-input,\n        .form-select,\n        .form-textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0.875rem 1rem;\n            border: 2px solid var(--color-quartz);\n            border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n            font-family: var(--font-body);\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            color: var(--color-charcoal);\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            background: var(--color-rose-mist);\n        }\n\n        .form-input:focus,\n        .form-select:focus,\n        .form-textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: var(--color-rose);\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        .form-textarea {\n            min-height: 120px;\n            resize: vertical;\n        }\n\n        .form-submit {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 1rem 2rem;\n            background: var(--color-rose);\n            color: white;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            gap: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-submit:hover {\n            background: var(--color-rose-dark);\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n        }\n\n        .form-submit svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           FOOTER\n        ======================================== */\n        .footer {\n            background: var(--color-charcoal);\n            color: white;\n            padding: var(--spacing-xl) 2rem 2rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-container {\n            max-width: 1200px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .footer-content {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 3rem;\n            margin-bottom: 3rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-brand h3 {\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-brand p {\n            color: var(--color-taupe-light);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links h4 {\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links ul li {\n            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a {\n            color: var(--color-taupe-light);\n            transition: color var(--transition-fast);\n        }\n\n        .footer-links a:hover {\n            color: var(--color-rose-light);\n        }\n\n        .footer-contact h4 {\n            margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        .footer-contact-item {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 0.75rem;\n            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n            color: var(--color-taupe-light);\n        }\n\n        .footer-contact-item svg {\n            width: 18px;\n            height: 18px;\n            color: var(--color-rose-light);\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n\n        .footer-bottom {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding-top: 2rem;\n            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            color: var(--color-taupe);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           WOW ANIMATIONS\n        ======================================== */\n        .wow-fade-up,\n        .wow-fade-in {\n            opacity: 0;\n            transform: translateY(30px);\n            transition: all 0.6s ease-out;\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-in {\n            transform: translateY(0) scale(0.95);\n        }\n\n        .wow-fade-up.visible,\n        .wow-fade-in.visible {\n            opacity: 1;\n            transform: translateY(0) scale(1);\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           RESPONSIVE DESIGN\n        ======================================== */\n        @media (max-width: 1024px) {\n            .hero-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                text-align: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-description {\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n            }\n\n            .hero-ctas {\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .hero-floating-card {\n                display: none;\n            }\n\n            .contact-container {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .nav-menu {\n                position: fixed;\n                top: 0;\n                right: -100%;\n                width: 80%;\n                max-width: 300px;\n                height: 100vh;\n                background: white;\n                flex-direction: column;\n                justify-content: center;\n                box-shadow: -5px 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n                transition: right var(--transition-base);\n            }\n\n            .nav-menu.active {\n                right: 0;\n            }\n\n            .mobile-toggle {\n                display: flex;\n            }\n\n            .section {\n                padding: var(--spacing-lg) 1.5rem;\n            }\n\n            .hero-ctas {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                align-items: center;\n            }\n\n            .btn {\n                width: 100%;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 480px) {\n            h1 {\n                font-size: 2rem;\n            }\n\n            h2 {\n                font-size: 1.75rem;\n            }\n\n            .hero-title {\n                margin-bottom: 1rem;\n            }\n\n            .hero-description {\n                font-size: 1rem;\n            }\n        }\n\n        /* ========================================\n           ACCESSIBILITY\n        ======================================== */\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            *,\n            *::before,\n            *::after {\n                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .btn:focus-visible,\n        .nav-link:focus-visible,\n        .form-input:focus-visible,\n        .form-select:focus-visible,\n        .form-textarea:focus-visible {\n            outline: 3px solid var(--color-rose);\n            outline-offset: 2px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <div class=\"nav-logo\">Dra. Caroline Cruz</div>\n            <div class=\"mobile-toggle\" id=\"mobileToggle\">\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n                <span></span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"nav-menu\" id=\"navMenu\">\n                <a href=\"#home\" class=\"nav-link\">Início</a>\n                <a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"nav-link\">Serviços</a>\n                <a href=\"#depoimentos\" class=\"nav-link\">Depoimentos</a>\n                <a href=\"#diferenciais\" class=\"nav-link\">Diferenciais</a>\n                <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"nav-cta\">Agendar Consulta</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n        <div class=\"hero-quartzes\">\n            <div class=\"quartz quartz-1\" data-parallax=\"1\"></div>\n            <div class=\"quartz quartz-2\" data-parallax=\"-1\"></div>\n            <div class=\"quartz quartz-3\" data-parallax=\"0.5\"></div>\n            <div class=\"quartz quartz-4\" data-parallax=\"-0.5\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-container\">\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <div class=\"hero-badge\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                    Estética Avançada em Ribeirão Preto\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Realce sua <span>beleza natural</span> com tratamentos exclusivos</h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-description\">Dra. Caroline Cruz - Especialista em harmonização facial, preenchimento labial, botox e rinomodelação. Resultados naturais que respeitam sua expressividade.</p>\n                <div class=\"hero-ctas\">\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">\n                        Agendar Consulta\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#servicos\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">\n                        Conhecer Tratamentos\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hero-image\">\n                <div class=\"hero-image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570172619644-dfd03ed5d881?w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Dra. Caroline Cruz - Harmonização Facial\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-floating-card card-1\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-text\">\n                        Resultados Naturais\n                        <span>Técnicas avançadas</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hero-floating-card card-2\">\n                    <div class=\"card-icon\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-text\">\n                        Cuidado Personalizado\n                        <span>Atendimento exclusivo</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Problem/Solution Section -->\n    <section class=\"section problem-solution\" id=\"problema-solucao\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Transformação Real</span>\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Sua autoestima renovada</h2>\n            <p class=\"section-description\">Entendemos suas necessidades e oferecemos soluções personalizadas</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"problem-solution-grid\">\n            <div class=\"ps-card problem wow-fade-up\">\n                <div class=\"ps-icon\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9.172 16.172a4 4 0 015.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Insatisfação com a aparência</h3>\n                <p>Sinais de envelhecimento, perda de volume facial e lábios que não correspondem à sua autoimagem podem afetar sua confiança.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ps-card problem wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"100\">\n                <div class=\"ps-icon\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Medo de resultados artificiais</h3>\n                <p>Muitas pessoas evitam tratamentos estéticos por receio de ficarem com uma aparência exagerada ou artificial.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ps-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"200\">\n                <div class=\"ps-icon\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Segurança e profissionalismo</h3>\n                <p>Atendimento com técnica apurada, produtos de alta qualidade e total segurança durante todo o processo.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ps-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"300\">\n                <div class=\"ps-icon\">\n                    <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n                <h3>Resultados naturais e harmoniosos</h3>\n                <p>Realce seus traços naturais com tratamentos que respeitam sua expressividade e individualidade.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services Section -->\n    <section class=\"section services\" id=\"servicos\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <span class=\"section-subtitle\">Tratamentos</span>\n            <h2 class=\"section-title\">Procedimentos especializados</h2>\n            <p class=\"section-description\">Soluções personalizadas para cada necessidade do seu rosto</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card wow-fade-up\">\n                <div class=\"service-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"Harmonização Facial\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-content\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Harmonização Facial</h3>\n                    <p>Equilibre os traços do seu rosto com preenchedores e toxina botulínica para uma aparência harmoniosa e natural.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"100\">\n                <div class=\"service-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"Toxina Botulínica\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-content\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3>Botox</h3>\n                    <p>Suavize linhas de expressão e rugas com aplicações estratégicas que mantêm sua expressividade natural.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#contato\" class=\"service-link\">\n                        Saiba mais\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\" />\n                        </svg>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card wow-fade-up\" data-delay=\"200\">\n                <div class=\"service-image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1634157703702-3c124b455499?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"Preenchedores Faciais\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-content\">\n                    <div class=\"service-icon\">\n                        <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M20 7l-8