{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_75f0fd7a289c4dd6935dfcd0","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Ralph Progress Log\n     2→\n     3→This file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\n     4→after each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n     5→\n     6→## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n     7→\n     8→*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n     9→\n    10→---\n    11→\n    12→## 2024-02-08 - US-048\n    13→- Created complete website for Dra. Angélica Lucena - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    14→- Files changed:\n    15→  - `site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena/index.html` (new)\n    16→- **Design Concept**: Ethereal/Luminous aesthetic with rose, gold, and champagne color palette. Organic blob shapes with floating animations create a dreamy, transformative atmosphere perfect for facial harmonization specialist.\n    17→- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Montserrat (body) for elegant, premium feel\n    18→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    19→  - Animated hero with 3 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    20→  - Parallax mouse movement effect on blobs\n    21→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    22→  - Problem/Solution section with visual cards\n    23→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    24→  - 3 testimonial cards with star ratings\n    25→  - 6 differential items with icons\n    26→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    27→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    28→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    29→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    30→- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 1928 - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14025-382 | (16) 99635-3208\n    31→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena\n    32→- **Verification**:\n    33→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n    34→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n    35→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n    36→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n    37→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    38→\n    39→**Learnings:**\n    40→- **Pattern**: Ethereal aesthetic works exceptionally well for facial harmonization/esthetic clinics - the soft gradients and luminous effects reinforce the \"glow\" and \"transformation\" aspects of the treatments\n    41→- **Pattern**: Using CSS variables for organic border-radius (`--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%`) creates unique blob shapes that animate beautifully\n    42→- **Pattern**: WhatsApp form integration is highly effective - converts form submissions directly into conversations\n    43→- **Gotcha**: Image URL from Unsplash (woman's face) appropriate for facial harmonization specialist\n    44→- **Gotcha**: The rose-gold-champagne palette (Ethereal Rose & Gold) creates a luxurious feminine aesthetic that appeals to the target demographic\n    45→- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond as display font adds sophistication and elegance without being overly formal\n    46→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    47→- **Mobile optimization**: Single-column layouts for grid components on mobile, stacked hero with image below content\n    48→\n    49→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    50→- **Ethereal Rose & Gold Palette**: `--color-blush: #F8E8E8`, `--color-rose: #E8B4B8`, `--color-gold: #C9A86C`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - perfect for aesthetic/esthetic clinics\n    51→- **Organic Blob Animation**: Multi-layer animated blobs with blur filters create depth and movement without being distracting\n    52→- **WhatsApp Form Handler**: JavaScript that formats form data into WhatsApp message and opens API URL directly\n    53→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic with soft greens and creamy whites\n    54→\n    55→---\n    56→\n    57→## 2024-02-08 - US-049\n    58→- Created complete website for Dra. Lara Costa - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    59→- Files changed:\n    60→  - `site-demo/dra-lara-costa/index.html` (new)\n    61→- **Design Concept**: Serene Sage & Pearl aesthetic with soft greens, creamy whites, and pearl/golden accents. Fresh, natural, and premium feel distinct from the rose/gold palette of US-048. Organic blob shapes with dual organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n    62→- **Typography**: Playfair Display (display) paired with Inter (body) for modern, elegant readability\n    63→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    64→  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    65→  - Dual organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob animations\n    66→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    67→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n    68→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    69→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n    70→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n    71→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    72→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    73→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    74→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    75→- **Contact Info**: Rua Milton José Robusti, 75 - Sala 506 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-613 | (16) 99788-7923\n    76→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-lara-costa\n    77→- **Verification**:\n    78→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n    79→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n    80→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n    81→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n    82→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    83→\n    84→**Learnings:**\n    85→- **Pattern**: Serene Sage & Pearl palette creates a fresh, natural aesthetic that differentiates from the rose/gold warmth of US-048 while maintaining premium positioning\n    86→- **Pattern**: Dual organic border-radius patterns (`--radius-organic` and `--radius-organic-2`) create more dynamic blob animations when combined with keyframe transforms\n    87→- **Pattern**: Gradient avatars for testimonials add visual interest and reinforce the color scheme\n    88→- **Gotcha**: The sage-green palette feels more modern and contemporary while still being feminine and elegant\n    89→- **Gotcha**: Playfair Display + Inter font pairing is slightly more modern/readable than Cormorant Garamond + Montserrat\n    90→- **Gotcha**: Adding 4th blob with lower opacity creates additional depth without overwhelming the design\n    91→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    92→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens\n    93→\n    94→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    95→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-sage-dark: #7FA68C`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic\n    96→- **Dual Organic Border Radius**: `--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%` and `--radius-organic-2: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 70% 30% 60%` for more dynamic blob animations\n    97→- **Pulsing Ring Animation**: CSS animation on differential icons creates subtle attention-grabbing effect without being distracting\n    98→- **Twilight Lavender & Mocha Palette**: `--color-lavender: #B8A5C4`, `--color-lavender-dark: #9A84A8`, `--color-mocha: #C4B5A8`, `--color-mocha-dark: #A89484`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - contemporary, fashion-forward aesthetic\n    99→- **Triple Organic Border Radius**: Third pattern `--radius-organic-3: 50% 50% 40% 60% / 50% 40% 60% 50%` for even more variety in blob animations\n   100→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6898a9ce-93aa-4b42-ba35-cf3221d0ea46","uuid":"146386c7-5934-4f1a-995d-85d3c3119d6c","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ac/Projetos/site-pixel-alchemy/site-pixel-alchemy/.ralph-tui/progress.md","content":"# Ralph Progress Log\n\nThis file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\nafter each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n\n## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n\n*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n\n---\n\n## 2024-02-08 - US-048\n- Created complete website for Dra. Angélica Lucena - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n- Files changed:\n  - `site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena/index.html` (new)\n- **Design Concept**: Ethereal/Luminous aesthetic with rose, gold, and champagne color palette. Organic blob shapes with floating animations create a dreamy, transformative atmosphere perfect for facial harmonization specialist.\n- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Montserrat (body) for elegant, premium feel\n- **Key Features Implemented**:\n  - Animated hero with 3 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n  - Parallax mouse movement effect on blobs\n  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n  - Problem/Solution section with visual cards\n  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n  - 3 testimonial cards with star ratings\n  - 6 differential items with icons\n  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 1928 - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14025-382 | (16) 99635-3208\n- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena\n- **Verification**:\n  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n\n**Learnings:**\n- **Pattern**: Ethereal aesthetic works exceptionally well for facial harmonization/esthetic clinics - the soft gradients and luminous effects reinforce the \"glow\" and \"transformation\" aspects of the treatments\n- **Pattern**: Using CSS variables for organic border-radius (`--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%`) creates unique blob shapes that animate beautifully\n- **Pattern**: WhatsApp form integration is highly effective - converts form submissions directly into conversations\n- **Gotcha**: Image URL from Unsplash (woman's face) appropriate for facial harmonization specialist\n- **Gotcha**: The rose-gold-champagne palette (Ethereal Rose & Gold) creates a luxurious feminine aesthetic that appeals to the target demographic\n- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond as display font adds sophistication and elegance without being overly formal\n- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n- **Mobile optimization**: Single-column layouts for grid components on mobile, stacked hero with image below content\n\n**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n- **Ethereal Rose & Gold Palette**: `--color-blush: #F8E8E8`, `--color-rose: #E8B4B8`, `--color-gold: #C9A86C`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - perfect for aesthetic/esthetic clinics\n- **Organic Blob Animation**: Multi-layer animated blobs with blur filters create depth and movement without being distracting\n- **WhatsApp Form Handler**: JavaScript that formats form data into WhatsApp message and opens API URL directly\n- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic with soft greens and creamy whites\n\n---\n\n## 2024-02-08 - US-049\n- Created complete website for Dra. Lara Costa - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n- Files changed:\n  - `site-demo/dra-lara-costa/index.html` (new)\n- **Design Concept**: Serene Sage & Pearl aesthetic with soft greens, creamy whites, and pearl/golden accents. Fresh, natural, and premium feel distinct from the rose/gold palette of US-048. Organic blob shapes with dual organic border-radius patterns create dynamic, breathing animations.\n- **Typography**: Playfair Display (display) paired with Inter (body) for modern, elegant readability\n- **Key Features Implemented**:\n  - Animated hero with 4 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n  - Dual organic border-radius patterns for more dynamic blob animations\n  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects on cards\n  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n- **Contact Info**: Rua Milton José Robusti, 75 - Sala 506 - Jardim Botânico, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14021-613 | (16) 99788-7923\n- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-lara-costa\n- **Verification**:\n  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n\n**Learnings:**\n- **Pattern**: Serene Sage & Pearl palette creates a fresh, natural aesthetic that differentiates from the rose/gold warmth of US-048 while maintaining premium positioning\n- **Pattern**: Dual organic border-radius patterns (`--radius-organic` and `--radius-organic-2`) create more dynamic blob animations when combined with keyframe transforms\n- **Pattern**: Gradient avatars for testimonials add visual interest and reinforce the color scheme\n- **Gotcha**: The sage-green palette feels more modern and contemporary while still being feminine and elegant\n- **Gotcha**: Playfair Display + Inter font pairing is slightly more modern/readable than Cormorant Garamond + Montserrat\n- **Gotcha**: Adding 4th blob with lower opacity creates additional depth without overwhelming the design\n- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens\n\n**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-sage-dark: #7FA68C`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic\n- **Dual Organic Border Radius**: `--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%` and `--radius-organic-2: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 70% 30% 60%` for more dynamic blob animations\n- **Pulsing Ring Animation**: CSS animation on differential icons creates subtle attention-grabbing effect without being distracting\n- **Twilight Lavender & Mocha Palette**: `--color-lavender: #B8A5C4`, `--color-lavender-dark: #9A84A8`, `--color-mocha: #C4B5A8`, `--color-mocha-dark: #A89484`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - contemporary, fashion-forward aesthetic\n- **Triple Organic Border Radius**: Third pattern `--radius-organic-3: 50% 50% 40% 60% / 50% 40% 60% 50%` for even more variety in blob animations\n","numLines":100,"startLine":1,"totalLines":185}}}
